    minh sang cho b\u1EA3n th\xE2n. S\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng chuy\u1EC3n n\xE0y s\u1EBD
    tr\u1EEB tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp v\xE0o m\xE1u. Khi kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111\u1ED3ng
    minh xung quanh \u0111\u1EC3 n\u1ED1i c\xE1p, s\u1EBD nh\u1EADn 50% Ph\xF2ng
    th\u1EE7."
